{
  "doc_id": "scene.chapter_37_Luminaire_Keeper",
  "chapter": 37,
  "title": null,
  "when": "Unknown.scene_chapter_37_Luminaire_Keeper",
  "where": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
  "scope": "narrative",
  "entities": [],
  "scene_id": "scene.chapter_37_Luminaire_Keeper",
  "segment_index": 0,
  "segment_count": 883,
  "segment_hash": "8e285cdb9e74",
  "block_title": "scene.chapter_37_Luminaire_Keeper",
  "beats": [
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "chapter 37: Luminaire Keeper"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Scorch lived up to its name at dawn."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Heat shimmered off the dunes like liquid gold, warping the horizon into a wavering mirage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sweat evaporated before it could bead, stolen by the parched air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires shuffled forward, cloaks pulled high against the glare, boots sinking ankle-deep in scalding sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pack-lizards snorted plumes of steam, their scaled hides darkened by dust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Even Zaron’s hum within Geralt’s armor felt muffled, dampened by the oppressive stillness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only Oreck moved with unbroken vigilance, his chroniton-flecked gaze scanning the blinding expanse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He felt it first – a low-frequency tremor transmitted through the sand, a vibration felt more than heard, prickling the skin beneath his scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not the wind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Something heavier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Deeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Midway down the strung-out column, Private Ren stumbled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He clutched his helmet, grimacing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Stars… my ears… ringing…\" Beside him, Corporal Vess frowned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It’s silent out here, Ren."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Too silent—\" Her words cut off as the ground erupted *behind* them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fountains of superheated sand geysered skyward, revealing three monstrous silhouettes clawing free."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dregans."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Towering slabs of distorted muscle and scarred hide, their useless wings pinned tight against bulging backs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their faces were grotesque masks of reptilian fury, eyes burning with agonized madness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One threw back its head, jaws distending impossibly wide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air itself seemed to *congeal*, then shatter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A focused beam of pure sonic torment ripped forward—not sound, but a physical wave of concussive disintegration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It struck the rearmost pack-lizard and its guard detail."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Flesh didn’t tear; it *crystallized*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires and beast alike froze mid-stride, then dissolved into clouds of glittering, crimson-stained dust that rained silently onto the sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The horrific silence after the scream was deafening."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Panic choked the Legion’s rear ranks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shields flared weakly, useless against resonant annihilation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Giantsbane deployed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s head snapped around."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The distant cloud of settling dust registered instantly—an attack vector slicing through his vulnerable rear."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Mika!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hold the front!\" His roar cut through the rising chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dragonmail plates flared with sudden, searing azure light as Zaron’s spirit surged, responding to imminent threat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Time seemed to warp; Geralt blurred forward, not running, but *flowing* impossibly fast across the dunes, sand kicking up in crystalline arcs behind him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He passed Oreck, already reversing course with terrifying speed, the green arrows along his greaves blazing like emerald beacons pointing *back*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Together, they closed the distance in heartbeats, arriving as a second Dragan drew breath to scream."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt didn't hesitate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He *leaped*, armored form crashing onto the Dragan’s broad back like a meteor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His gauntleted fist, wreathed in crackling temporal energy, slammed down *not* onto bone, but onto the thick cartilage ridge at the base of its skull—a critical resonator node."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The impact pulsed visibly, a ripple of distorted air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Dragan’s scream choked into a wet, gurgling gasp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its sonic blast misfired internally; blood and ruptured organs sprayed from its jaws."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Simultaneously, Oreck lunged low."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His cleaver wasn’t aimed to kill, but to *disable*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The obsidian edge, humming with chroniton green, sliced precisely through the thick tendon anchoring a third Dragan’s colossal leg to its hip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The creature bellowed in agony, crashing sideways, its next scream lost in a roar of primal pain and frustration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The immediate threat stalled, but the peril was far from over."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The screech of southern reinforcements echoed—allied Dregans summoned by the breach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Scorch drank deeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The southern Dregans erupted onto the scene with terrifying silence, their larger, sand-polished hides absorbing the harsh sunlight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No handlers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No hesitation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The lead Dragan’s territorial challenge cry wasn’t aimed at Geralt’s forces, but at their northern kin—a wave of discordant force slamming the raging attackers sideways."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The effect was immediate, visceral."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The northern Dregans, consumed by genetic fury, whirled as one pack-beast, abandoning the legionnaires entirely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s assessment was a low growl felt in Geralt’s bones: \"Territory.\" The ensuing clash was apocalyptic—a whirlwind of snapping spines, sonic blasts detonating prematurely, sand fused instantly into glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires watched, shields trembling against debris, as giants tore each other apart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s bio-scanner whirred frantically, tracking the horrifying cascade of energy signatures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pragmatism, indeed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The victors weren’t saviors; they were conquerors clearing their hunting grounds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their departure left only the groans of the dying northern Dragan Oreck crippled and the settling crimson dust of its vaporized kin."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence reclaimed the desert, heavier now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s fist lowered slowly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Regroup,\" he commanded, the word scraping raw."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Secure the wounded.\" Bodies crystallized beyond the shield perimeter glittered accusingly under the merciless sun."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren retched violently into the sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s gaze flicked to Lyra."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Stabilize Halvar *now*.\" The healer nodded, already moving, filaments pulsing urgent cyan towards the stunned veteran."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Integration wasn't a choice anymore."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Scorch demanded it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Adapt or die."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The deeper enemy waited, casting shadows far darker than Dragan packs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air thickened, losing its knife’s edge dryness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Boots crunched on gravelly earth now, sand yielding to cracked hardpan radiating heat upward like coals."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ahead, blinding white salt flats stretched—cracked crusts whispering false promises of water under the midday glare."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s dragonmail hummed differently here; Zaron’s spirit recoiled faintly against the mineral scent carried on sudden, sluggish breezes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Thorny bushes clawed upward from the baking soil, razor-edged grasses scratching against scaled greaves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence draped itself like a shroud."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No wind whispers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only the scuff of weary boots and the low thrum of shield generators."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then, a sharp cry echoed—Corporal Vess stumbled backward from a low mound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her boot sank calf-deep into liquefied clay where solid ground seemed moments before."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The earth pulsed visibly around her leg, drawing her deeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Panic flared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck surged forward, his chroniton-enhanced strength anchoring him on firmer ground as he seized Vess’s arm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Don’t struggle!\" Mika barked, seeing the suction intensify."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The clay gulped hungrily."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Guide her slowly!\" Geralt ordered, scanning the treacherous basin—this was no desert."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was the land’s wounded throat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ground betrayed them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Steps that felt solid crumbled into sucking mud without warning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sweat plastered hair to necks, no longer evaporating but soaking into grit-stained fatigues."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ahead, the Breathing Pyramid rose—a scarred monument of volcanic rock and sagging sandstone, its lower half dissolving into the shimmering haze of swamp breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stagnant ponds festered; alkali rims glowed poisonous white beneath twin moons."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mosquitoes whined incessantly, a maddening chorus Lyra silenced near Halvar with targeted micro-pulses from her rig."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Pulse… stronger here,\" Oreck rumbled, cleaver tip pointing downward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beneath their feet, the faintest tremor resonated—sub-audible, felt through bone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Void Spire’s dormant song."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt halted the column before the pyramid’s shadowed entrance, a collapsed archway channeling dark water inward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His claw traced the air before the eroded stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A shimmering resonance field flickered—dry volcanic stone resisting humid decay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The threshold,\" he stated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His armored palm pressed against the stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Scales flared bright azure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The stone groaned… shifted… revealing a slick descent into cloying darkness smelling of wet earth and ozone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Buried Luminaire awaited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its trapped lightning would be their guide… or their grave."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika tightened her grip on her shock-lance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Single file."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shields synced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Watch for voids.\" The descent began."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The stairway breathed beneath them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Water lapped at crumbling steps."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton arrows on Oreck’s greaves cast jade fractals over algae-slick walls."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence choked the passage—not the desert’s stillness, but the swamp’s heavy, listening quiet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only the rhythmic drip of condensation pierced it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt moved like shadow given form, Zaron’s spirit coiled taut within the armor, sensing dimensional fractures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A legionnaire’s boot slipped on wet stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s hand snapped out, steadying him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Three seconds,\" she hissed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Scan your footing.\" Lyra’s filaments pulsed cyan, mapping the unstable geometry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance spikes ahead,\" she whispered, voice tight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Micro-voids."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Unstable.\" The corridor widened abruptly into a cavernous cistern."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "At its heart, rising from black water, stood the Void Spire—a needle of pure obsidian humming with trapped thunder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above it, refracted through murk, the Buried Luminaire’s crystalline core glowed… but its light was sickly, threaded with veins of deep violet corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Queen’s touch."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s fist clenched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Prime Keeper’s shard."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Under siege.\" Oreck’s growl vibrated the air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Anchor point… compromised.\" The water rippled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shapes coalesced in the gloom—pale, multi-limbed, drawn by the dissonant light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Guardians twisted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or hungry things."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s bio-scanner hissed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Multiple bio-signatures… converging!\" Shapes slithered from flooded alcoves—pale, segmented horrors with too many jointed limbs ending in needle-claws."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sludge-drakes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Bioluminescent spores dotted their carapaces, pulsing sickly violet in sync with the corrupted Luminaire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They moved silently, chitin scraping wet stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik’s arrow flew first, a chroniton-tipped streak punching through a leading drake’s eye cluster."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It detonated in a spray of ichor and temporal shrapnel, staggering two others."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck met the next wave head-on."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His cleaver wasn’t a blade; it was a chroniton storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Green energy sheared through chitin, triggering cascading temporal decay in the wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Flesh aged centuries in seconds, crumbling to dust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika coordinated the shield wall—legionnaires locking overlapping fields just as a drake spat a glob of acidic phlegm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It sizzled against the barrier, filling the air with acrid fumes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt didn’t engage the drakes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He moved toward the Spire, Zaron’s spirit blazing within him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon-armor resonated, countering the violet corruption threading the Spire’s base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Azure light fought violet rot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Mika!\" Geralt roared over the fray."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Cover Lyra!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She needs access!\" Integration became combat triage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The healer scrambled forward, rig unfolding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her target wasn't the drakes, but the Luminaire itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stabilize the anchor… or lose them all to the Queen’s hunger."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The spire hummed louder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The very air crackled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Water rippled against Geralt's boots as he reached the Spire’s obsidian base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s spectral talons manifested fully now, clawing at the violet corruption like physical rot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each touch sent shivers through the stone, dislodging calcified sediment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra slid beside him, her rig’s injectors unfolding like metallic spiders."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Direct infusion required!\" she yelled, voice strained against the Spire’s rising thrum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Counter-resonance!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the pattern’s chaotic!\" Geralt’s helm tilted, focusing past the battle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He heard it—the Luminaire’s fractured song beneath the Queen’s static."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Sing it *clear*,\" he commanded Lyra."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Not against the chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through it.\" Her filaments flared cyan, syncing with Geralt’s dragon-resonance… seeking harmony in dissonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The spire pulsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light flared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The violet veins flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dimmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For an instant, the Luminaire’s core shone pure, trapped lightning refracted through murk—a dazzling prism of sound made visible."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hope sparked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the Sludge-drake Alpha emerged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twice the size of the others, its carapace bore scars of Anunnaki implants forcibly welded to its spine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It reared, throat swelling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not acid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A beam of corrupted luminescence ripped toward Lyra—a mimicry of the Spire’s own power, twisted and vile."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika lunged, shield-first."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The blast hammered her back, cracking her kinetic field like glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She skidded across wet stone, gasping."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck intercepted the Alpha’s follow-up strike."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His cleaver met its descending claw."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Metal screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton sparks showered the water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar and Torren flanked the beast, blades useless against its thick plates."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik peppered its eyes, buying seconds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s focus never wavered from the Spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s power intensified."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Azure light coiled around the obsidian needle, peeling back the violet corruption strand by agonizing strand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s hands trembled as her filaments fused deeper into the resonance field."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Almost… synced!\" The Alpha screeched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its tail whipped, sending Torren crashing into a crumbling wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar leapt atop its back, dagger stabbing for implant seams."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Useless."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The beast bucked, flinging him into dark water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika staggered upright, shock-lance spitting unstable energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Geralt!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We need—\"."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire flared again."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Brighter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cleaner."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Alpha recoiled, its corrupted light beam sputtering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck seized the moment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His cleaver plunged into the beast’s neck joint."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not flesh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The chroniton blade targeted the pulsing Anunnaki implant grafted to its spine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Melted wiring exploded outward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Alpha shrieked, collapsing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence fell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only the drip of water and the Luminaire’s pure, strengthening hum remained."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra withdrew her filaments, swaying."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Anchor stabilized… for now.\" The violet veins were faded ghosts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But beneath the obsidian spire, the water still churned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Something deeper than drakes stirred."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The descent wasn’t over."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt turned toward the Stair’s shadowed continuation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Move.\" Integration had bought them time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Darkness ahead?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "That was revelation’s price."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"*The Cavern of Nammus - Atmospheric Entry*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Stair swallowed them whole."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each downward step crushed Geralt’s shoulders tighter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Condensation wept from fused basalt walls, slick beneath scaled boots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Air thickened—metal-tanged humidity pressing like drowned lungs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No desert wind dared trespass here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only the Spire’s ghost-light bled upward, painting jagged silhouettes that danced with each flicker."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaire Corvin gasped behind Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A choked sound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then retching."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pressure sickness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s buried song wasn’t heard—*felt*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It vibrated ribcages, warping inner ears."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Equilibrium shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shieldbearer Jax stumbled sideways, helmet amplifying the dissonance into a skull-drilling whine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tinnitus screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vertigo pulled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below, the shaft breathed—a subsonic groan resonating through stone and bone alike."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s dragonmail flared azure, Zaron’s will anchoring him against the pull. *One step lower and your stomach drops—the resonance isn’t sound, it’s gravity bending.* He gripped Corvin’s pauldron, hauling him upright against the trembling wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sweat carved trails through grime on pale faces."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only the drip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And the hum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"*Resonant Chamber - Cavern One*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shaft opened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A cathedral-sized dome unfolded—stalactites hung like shattered chandeliers, wrapped in crystalline filaments humming with trapped resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Water pooled ankle-deep, hiding razor-edged mineral ridges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt motioned: halt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sound here wasn't trust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Corporal Vess’s whisper echoed back seconds later—*\"Watch the—\"*—overlapping her own caution."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Auditory ghosts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hallucinations whispered commands Mika never gave."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaire Ren spun, shock-lance raised toward empty darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Who’s there?\" Oreck’s amber gaze scanned the vaulted ceiling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Translucent shapes clung there—blind, choral fauna, spider-limbed and thin as paper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Harmonic pulses rippled across their bodies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A dropped power-cell clanged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instantly, the creatures *stirred*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legs unfolding in eerie silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They flowed down stalactites like liquid shadow, drawn to the sound’s epicenter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s hand signal was sharp: *Absolute silence.* Survival demanded it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Move slow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Step careful."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust nothing your ears say."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fauna settled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every scrape of boot, every rasp of breath, risked awakening the choir."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"*Erosion Galleries - Cavern Two*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Basalt yielded to fossilized roots—massive, petrified veins from the swamp above."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Water surged without warning, thigh-high torrents roaring through twisting tunnels."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires braced against carved walls slick with millennia of scum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s rig flashed methane warnings: 82% saturation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One spark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One misfiring shield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Annihilation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt pressed forward, Zaron’s resonance mapping safe paths through labyrinthine gloom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren argued with Halvar, voice tight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We entered this gallery *minutes* ago!\" Halvar rasped back, \"Hours!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Feel this ache?\" Temporal drift."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Humidity and void resonance stretched seconds into subjective eternities."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Compasses spun wildly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maps dissolved into madness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Navigation became faith."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust Geralt’s armored back cutting through the reeking dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust Oreck’s chroniton arrows flaring green at intersections."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust nothing else."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Especially not time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"*Heart Chamber - Cavern Three*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light stabbed their eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The obsidian Void Spire plunged downward into the Lucid Storm—an underground lake burning with captured energy, teal and blinding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Static crackled across Geralt’s vambrace, shorting displays."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaire shields flickered, failing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra cursed as her medicae rig sparked, injectors dropping inert."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Bioluminescent horrors—eel-things woven from lightning—snaked through the water, drawn to kinetic fields."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika glanced left."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren’s reflection shimmered on the lake surface—not his scarred face, but a sneering warlord draped in Anunnaki sigils."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar recoiled from his own reflection: a skeletal husk bleeding shadow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt saw Zaren’s dragon form fractured, scales edged in violet rot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s light didn’t illuminate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It judged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck moved first."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Boots struck water—and the storm ignited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Arcs of raw electricity spiderwebbed outward, seeking conduits."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gear sparked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shields died."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren screamed as an eel-thing latched onto his greave, bioelectricity seizing his muscles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar hacked it free, blade sizzling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s reflection leered: *Weakness costs lives*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She fired her shock-lance point-blank into the water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mist rose, stinging ozone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt waded deeper, Zaron’s spirit warring with the storm’s pull."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Azure scales flared brighter, repelling arcs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the reflections... they whispered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaren’s dragon-shadow coiled in the ripples: *Accept her power."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Let them burn.* Truth’s weight crushed his ribs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each step sank him deeper into liquid light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra stumbled, rig sputtering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance overload!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gear’s failing!\" Her own reflection showed her hands decayed, bones protruding—a healer’s failure made flesh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire pulsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not a beacon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A predator."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It sensed Geralt’s proximity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The lake boiled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Energy tendrils lashed, wrapping his legs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron roared within him, a sound swallowed by static."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika fought beside him, shieldless, lance spearing eel-things."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren dragged Halvar from the water, both convulsing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then came the voice—not sound, but thought etching bone:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"*ASCEND OR ANCHOR.*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Images flooded Geralt’s mind: Oreck disintegrating."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika dissolving into light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires vaporized as raw power surged through him—dragon wings unfurling against the void."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s core glowed hungrily behind tangled roots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sacrifice them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Become its master."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence the storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet trembled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beneath the water, the storm gathered strength."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cracked sandstone stairs vanished beneath ankle-deep water slick with condensation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each step echoed too loud, too soon—a drumbeat swallowed by damp stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt led, boots sinking into unseen silt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, the ceiling wept mineral tears that hissed against heated armor seals."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below, the Void Spire’s ghost-light bled upward, painting the shaft walls into jagged, shifting silhouettes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaire Bren gasped behind him—a wet, choked sound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then retching."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pressure sickness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s buried song wasn’t heard. *Felt*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It vibrated ribcages, warping inner ears."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Equilibrium shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shieldbearer Kael stumbled sideways, his helmet amplifying the dissonance into a skull-drilling whine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tinnitus screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vertigo pulled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shaft breathed—a subsonic groan resonating through stone and bone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s dragonmail flared azure, Zaron’s will anchoring him. *One step lower and your stomach drops—the resonance isn’t sound, it’s gravity bending.* He hauled Bren upright against the trembling wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sweat carved trails through grime."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only the drip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And the hum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The stairs opened into a cavern dome—a hollowed cathedral of fused basalt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stalactites hung like shattered chandeliers, draped in crystalline filaments humming with trapped resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Water pooled ankle-deep, hiding razor-edged mineral ridges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt raised a fist: halt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sound here betrayed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Corporal Vess whispered, *\"Watch the—\"*—her own caution echoed back seconds later, overlapping."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Auditory ghosts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hallucinations hissed commands Mika never gave."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaire Ren spun, shock-lance aimed at empty dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Who’s there?\" Oreck’s amber gaze scanned the vault."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Translucent shapes clung above—blind choral fauna, spider-limbed and paper-thin."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Harmonic pulses rippled across their bodies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A power-cell slipped from Bren’s belt. *Clang.* The creatures *stirred*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legs unfolding in liquid silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They flowed down stalactites toward the sound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s hand sliced air: *Absolute silence.* Survival demanded it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Move slow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Step careful."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust nothing your ears say."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fauna settled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every scrape of boot risked awakening the choir."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Basalt yielded to fossilized roots—massive, petrified veins from the swamp far above."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Water surged without warning, thigh-high torrents roaring through twisting galleries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires braced against walls slick with millennia of scum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s rig flashed methane warnings: 82% saturation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One spark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One misfiring shield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Annihilation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt pressed forward, Zaron’s resonance tracing safe paths through the reeking gloom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren gripped Halvar’s arm, voice frayed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We entered this passage *minutes* ago!\" Halvar rasped back, \"Hours!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Feel this ache?\" Temporal drift."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Humidity and void resonance stretched seconds into subjective eternities."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Compasses spun wild."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maps dissolved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Navigation became faith—trust Geralt’s armored back cutting through darkness, trust Oreck’s chroniton arrows flaring green at junctions."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust nothing else."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Especially not time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light stabbed their eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The obsidian Spire plunged into the Lucid Storm—an underground lake burning teal with captured energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Static crackled across Geralt’s vambrace, shorting displays."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaire shields flickered, dying."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra cursed as her medicae rig sparked, injectors falling inert."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Bioluminescent horrors—eel-things woven from lightning—snaked through the water, drawn to kinetic fields."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika glanced left."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren’s reflection shimmered on the lake: not his scarred face, but a sneering warlord draped in Anunnaki sigils."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar recoiled from his own—a skeletal husk bleeding shadow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt saw Zaren’s dragon form fractured, scales edged in violet rot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s light didn’t illuminate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It judged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck moved first."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Boots struck water—and the storm ignited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Arcs spiderwebbed, seeking conduits."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gear sparked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shields died."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren screamed as an eel-thing latched onto his greave, bioelectricity seizing muscle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar hacked it free, blade sizzling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s reflection leered: *Weakness costs lives*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She fired her lance into the water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mist rose, stinging ozone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt waded deeper, Zaron’s spirit warring with the storm’s pull."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Azure scales flared brighter, repelling arcs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the reflections whispered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaren’s dragon-shadow coiled in ripples: *Accept her power."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Let them burn.* Truth’s weight crushed him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each step sank deeper into liquid light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra stumbled, rig sputtering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance overload!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gear’"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire pulsed beneath the tangled roots—not a beacon, but a predator."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its core glowed hungrily behind knotted metal, half-submerged in opaque teal liquid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Voices layered—Geralt heard Mika’s clipped orders, Oreck’s tactical silence, and his own thoughts looping back as distorted commands: *Leave them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ascend.* The cavern groaned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton crystals embedded in the ceiling wept glowing droplets that hissed where they struck the water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaire Bren clutched his helmet as his own reflection screamed silently up at him—a hollow-eyed prisoner bound in chains he’d forged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The roots… they’re shifting!\" Lyra yelled, voice frayed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s casing trembled, metal vines uncoiling like awakened serpents."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One lashed out, wrapping Torren’s ankle, dragging him toward the luminous pool."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar lunged, shock-lance spitting futile sparks against the resonant shield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet vibrated—Zaron’s roar reduced to static."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"*ASCEND OR ANCHOR.*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The choice carved itself into his bones."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Images: Oreck disintegrating into light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika dissolving."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Five hundred souls vaporized as raw power surged through him—dragon wings unfurling against the void."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence the storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Claim the spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Become its master."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sacrifice the anchor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s breath hitched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beneath the water, the roots tightened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s medicae rig spat a final spark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her reflection showed bone where flesh should be—a healer’s failure made manifest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She met Geralt’s eyes across the churning light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It needs balance,\" she gasped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Not a master."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An anchor.\" The Luminaire flared, its light searing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika fought beside him, shieldless, lance spearing another root-tendril."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton droplets rained down like molten stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Time liquefied."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar hauled Torren free, both bleeding phosphorescent fluid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cavern walls shimmered, dissolving into resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt plunged his clawed hand into the pool."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not toward the core."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Into the root-mass choking it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s will surged—not domination, but *alignment*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Azure light flared from his gauntlet, weaving through the metal vines."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The roots stiffened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s pulse stuttered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, the storm stilled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reflections cleared—Mika’s fierce determination, Oreck’s unwavering vigilance, Lyra’s exhausted resolve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Real."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Uncorrupted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the roots *shrieked*, recoiling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The pool churned black as the Luminaire’s light dimmed to ember-red."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Something deeper than roots stirred in the depths."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Revelation’s price waited in the dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika seized the moment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Shieldbearers—cyclonic pattern!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cover the Commander!\" Legionnaires formed overlapping arcs, sparking lances pointed outward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra scrambled backward, rig spitting diagnostics."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The resonance... shifting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It’s rejecting the corruption!\" Her voice trembled with awe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, chroniton crystals fractured."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Droplets fell like molten lead, searing water into toxic steam."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck hauled Torren onto a petrified root-island, the warrior’s leg weeping phosphorescent ichor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar stood guard, blade singing as he severed another questing tendril."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cavern groaned—a sound of tectonic agony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt remained waist-deep, Zaron’s light fighting the encroaching shadow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Integration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not control."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire wasn’t a tool."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a wounded god."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s fingers flew over her Medicae Rig’s scorched panel."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Commander... the null state Sahvant theorized?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara—she didn’t retreat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She *split*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A fragment anchored in stasis...\" Her eyes locked on Geralt’s dragonmail."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"...the other became the storm.\" The implications hung thick."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s light judged because it was broken."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her harmony sought not a master, but harmony itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s breath caught."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaren’s ghost-shadow whispered again: *Burn the roots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ascend*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But Mika’s reflection—steadfast, unyielding—answered silently: *Anchor us*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The roots coiled tighter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below Geralt’s boots, the lakebed trembled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wisdom came not from dragons, but desperation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt tore a chroniton arrow from Oreck’s quiver—its green glow stark against Zaron’s blue."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He plunged it into the root-mass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light exploded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not azure or emerald, but pure, blinding white."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The roots shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Luminaire flared—not predatory, but *awakening*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For an instant, Geralt saw her: Luminara, fractured yet radiant, a being of crystallized harmonics reaching through the void."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then agony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The spire’s full resonance hammered him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dragon scales cracked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Flesh burned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron roared—a sound of triumph and dissolution."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The walls dissolved into starlight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cavern vanished."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above the dunes, Earth’s Spire flared gold, announcing their presence to the cosmos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stood on obsidian glass fused by his own power."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires stared, shields dark, lances lowered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below, the lake flowed clear."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Healing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s voice hummed through Geralt’s shattered armor: *\"Anchor established."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Transit protocols initiated.\"* Mika touched the liquid—not teal, but silver."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"She’s mapping coordinates.\" Lyra collapsed, her rig humming as it repaired itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Integration complete."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The null state… she didn’t hide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She synchronized.\" Halvar flexed his hand—no trace of decay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck scanned the horizon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton sight showed branching paths: Mars, scarred and waiting; Dragon Nebula, shimmering beyond time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The storm hadn’t ended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It had shifted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s light settled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Warm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Welcoming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet pulsed with hers—a crystalline key embedded in his palm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not control."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Symbiosis."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Mars Spire,\" he rasped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"She’ll tear it open.\" Mika traced the fractal patterns forming on the sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"And announce us to every spire in the network.\" Legionnaires murmured—fear, awe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra injected Halvar with stabilized chroniton fluid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Transit requires precise resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One error…\" She trailed off."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The desert wind carried whispers: Anunnaki signatures converging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Distant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck slammed his cleaver into the glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Green fire traced Mars’ coordinates."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"She holds the gateway."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We walk it.\" Geralt flexed his new hand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s presence lingered—dimmer, fused."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dragon and keeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anchor and storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s final warning echoed: *\"They hunt keepers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They hunt me.\"* The dunes shimmered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not with heat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "With transit signatures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika loaded her lance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then we hunt first.\" Five hundred souls readied weapons."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, Earth’s spire pulsed gold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula watched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Judgment had come."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s bio-scanner flared crimson."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anunnaki signatures surged—not distant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Converging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Seven minutes!\" she yelled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sand hardened beneath Geralt’s boots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silver light bled from cracks, forming a vast sigil—a dragon coiled around a spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anchor points."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Transit paths."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Formation Rho!\" Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires locked shields."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck planted chroniton arrows at each node."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar gripped his blade, knuckles white."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren limped forward, ichor-stained bandage taut."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"For Ironspire!\" The cry rose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Brittle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Defiant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sand fused into obsidian beneath them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Static hummed in teeth and bone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sigil ignited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires dissolved into silver mist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt the void—cold, silent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then pressure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Crushing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s ghost-shield flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s voice cut through: *\"Resonance destabilizing!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton interference!\"* A shadow coalesced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not Anunnaki."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wyrm-like."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Void-bleached scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Keeper-eater."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It struck."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt parried, dragonmail screeching."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton claws sheared azure scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pain blazed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika materialized mid-lunge, lance spearing its eye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It recoiled, shrieking silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrow pinned its tail."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s blade severed tendon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Teamwork."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anchored."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The beast dissolved into ash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Transit resumed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mars loomed—scarred, crimson, waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Dragonwayne Nebula shimmered in the black."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Approval."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or warning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Landing was impact."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Bone-jarring."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sand replaced by rusted regolith."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Mars spire stabbed the horizon—cracked, weeping violet corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt rose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Five hundred stood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Behind them, the silver gateway collapsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ahead, shambling forms emerged from dust-devils."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not soldiers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twisted spire-constructs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Half-metal, half-flesh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s light pulsed in Geralt’s palm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Warmth against Martian cold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"She’s weak here,\" Lyra warned, scanner glitching."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Corruption resonance overwhelming.\" Oreck nocked an arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then we purify.\" Geralt drew his sword."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dragonfire ignited the blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"For Earth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For anchors.\" The constructs charged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence fell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only the spire’s broken heartbeat throbbed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s consciousness flared painfully."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt her fragmentation—**Earth Prime Resonance Keeper**, stretched thin across dimensions."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her whispers were static: *\"Anchor points destabilizing... locus integrity failing...\"* Her nature revealed: not a weapon, but a symphony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Harmonics clashed as Mika’s lance pierced a construct’s core."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instead of shattering, it *screamed*—a discordant note silencing her comms."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’re siphon points!\" Lyra yelled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Disrupting her harmonics!\" Halvar roared, cleaving through rusted plating."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton decay slowed his blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torren covered him, shield sparking."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each strike fed the spire’s corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet pulsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s resonance surged—blue fire met violet decay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Feedback seared his nerves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wasn’t fighting constructs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was fighting Luminara’s corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her agony was theirs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, the Dragon Nebula shimmered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Aelxion’s spectral gaze pierced the void."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The **Draconic Warden of Breach** saw the frayed connection—Geralt’s key struggling against Mars’ dissonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not a flaw."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A plea."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara needed equilibrium."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Oreck!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton lattice!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sector Gamma pattern!\" Arrows flew."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Green light wove a containment field."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The constructs faltered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra injected her rig into the fused sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance override initiating!\" Luminara’s voice strengthened: *\"Syncing... anchor restored.\"* The spire pulsed gold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Momentary."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Violet shadows recoiled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A path opened—a fracture in the spire’s base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika pointed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"There!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The core nexus!\" But Nyxthoria’s warning echoed from the nebula: Balance demanded sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Void flames flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fracture bled darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Keepers hunted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anchors tested."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sky tore open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reality rippled like heat haze over a forge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Massive silhouettes glided across the Martian stars—not ships, but **living eclipses**."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wings blotted out Deimos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Scales caught the light of Phobos, glittering with crimson fire and nebular gold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vaelros descended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A roar unheard in vacuum shook the regolith beneath Geralt’s boots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beside him, VALDRASIL units phased into existence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Serpentine forms flickered between crystalline matter and emerald energy, executing impossible turns."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their jittering movements left afterimages—ghostly shimmers clawing at the mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One VALDRASIL streaked toward a bronze dragon, scales catching a dying sun’s fury."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Impossible."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Terrifying."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence screamed louder than battle cries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s grip loosened on his blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Entropy beams lanced out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not fire, but void made manifest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twisting black-and-silver ribbons swallowed starlight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Where they struck a VALDRASIL, the serpent didn’t explode."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It unraveled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Color drained."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Form dissolved into translucency."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As if it never existed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s chroniton-sight flared—Zaron’s panic spiking at the violation of physics."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beside him, Lyra’s scanner shorted out, vomiting sparks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance collapse!\" she shrieked soundlessly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, dragons retaliated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torrents of plasma—stellar fire twisted into solar prominences—erupted in electric blue and violent purple."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They washed over Anunnaki dreadnoughts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Metal vaporized into lingering nebulae—glowing gravesites slowly fading."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Temporal weapons warped the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Patches of space kaleidoscoped into probability cascades."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light bent around invisible singularities, lensing stars into impossible arcs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Bio-electric pulses flashed—green and violet lightning arcing between combatants."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The entire sky ignited in neon auroras: corrosive yellows pulsing with distant detonations."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires shielded their eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrow trembled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below the cosmic ballet, Geralt’s army stood exposed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Undisciplined."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Unanchored."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Violet corruption pulsed from the spire’s base—Luminara’s fracture weeping darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "VALDRASIL phantoms skimmed low, targeting the Legion’s chroniton signatures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s lance flared uselessly against phased matter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Shields!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Rho formation—now!\" Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Too late."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A VALDRASIL solidified overhead, crystalline jaws wide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its bio-electric maw crackled—aimed at Halvar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt lunged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dragonfire met green lightning in a silent detonation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires scattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shields buckled under stray entropy shrapnel."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two men crystallized mid-sprint—their terror frozen in obsidian glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’re harvesting us!\" Lyra gasped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Feeding the spire’s decay!\" Geralt’s symbiosis with Luminara faltered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her light dimmed against Mars’ dissonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anchor points dissolved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula watched—T’Zurakai’s sapphire gaze tracking every branching doom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then—the void answered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Space rippled again."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not dragons."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not VALDRASIL."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A serpentine shadow—longer than Vaelros’ wingspan—coiled into existence. **Void-wyrm**."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Starlit scars marred its anti-light scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It heard resonance—the spire’s corruption, Geralt’s key, VALDRASIL’s discord."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instinctual."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It descended toward the fracture."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Armies froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dragons banked away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "VALDRASIL phased erratically."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dread washed cold through Geralt’s veins."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Survival demanded silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But Luminara’s agony sang too loud."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Death loomed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then—a spark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not cosmic fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Elemental."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earthborn."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From swirling dust—a pinprick ignored by gods and wyrms alike—four figures solidified."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Impossible."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Youthful faces etched with ageless authority."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Recognition flared hot in Geralt’s chest—impossible recognition."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "First: Clad in dragonmail like his own—but azure scales crackling with primal lightning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Eyes blazing crimson."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He moved—a blur of cobalt and storm-fire—fist striking the void-wyrm’s descending snout."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A shockwave tore silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Molecular bonds screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lightning crawled across anti-scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The wyrm recoiled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not hurt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stunned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Second: Robes of solar fusion—amber, gold, blinding white."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No mage’s garb."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Battle-raiment forged of stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He raised an open palm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A feather—incandescent—spun free."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not thrown."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chosen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It curved impossibly, slicing through phased VALDRASIL constructs like they were smoke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each touch ignited silent supernovas within their cores."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dissolution became celebration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The void wept light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Third: Royalty incarnate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Armored in twilight silk and starlight plate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Eyes closed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Head tilted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her fingers danced in empty air—reweaving spacetime like thread."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "VALDRASIL phantoms near Halvar simply... ceased existing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Unmade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not destroyed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Erased from possibility."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She stood utterly still."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Absolute war waged unseen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fourth: Where shadow fought substance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Barely visible—a flicker at the edge of sight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Yet shadows obeyed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She stepped—not walked—between Legionnaires."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Where his passing shade touched crystalline soldiers?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They crumbled into harmless obsidian sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Precision perfected."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Death as artistry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The assault lasted seconds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Immediate threats vanished."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Annihilated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The crimson warrior turned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His eyes—Geralt’s own eyes—locked onto Geralt’s."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Recognition deeper than blood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A silent nod."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Acknowledgement."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Warning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then—a bronze dragon descended like fury incarnate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They leapt onto its back—four impossible saviors—vanishing into the cosmic storm above."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Leaving only the echo of thunder and the scent of ozone deep within Geralt’s soul."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Questions burned hotter than dragonfire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ancestors?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Heirs?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or something far stranger?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula watched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Judgment paused."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Curiosity sparked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence crashed down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A fleeting pause—a breath stolen from chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Now!\" Geralt roared, his voice slicing through stunned stillness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Anchors—form!\" Time bled away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Mars Spire pulsed, its violet corruption recoiling from Luminara’s renewed harmonic surge within Geralt’s gauntlet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fracture lay exposed—a jagged tear weeping entropy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Forget the war overhead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Forget the strangers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The window was slim: Luminaire’s brief purification."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar slammed his chroniton-infused blade into the fused glass ground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Circuits aligned!\" Oreck’s arrows traced the dragon-spire sigil, green fire igniting dormant pathways."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s shieldbearers locked overlapping fields—a shimmering dome beneath the fractured sky."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires surged forward, not toward battle, but toward resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Precision replaced panic."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was not war."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was surgery."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The core nexus beckoned—a pulsing heart of corrupted crystal deep within the spire’s base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s rig spat diagnostics onto the sand: \"Harmonic dissonance peaking—threshold in eighteen seconds!\" Geralt plunged his gauntlet into the fracture."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s agony seared his nerves—but beneath the violet decay, her true song fought."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Golden."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Desperate for release."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Pour it into her!\" Geralt commanded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck channeled chroniton stability through the lattice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s shieldbearers amplified Luminaire’s fading pulse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar roared as his blade glowed white-hot, severing corrupted energy tendrils anchoring the decay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion became a single instrument."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Five hundred souls resonating with one purpose: cleanse the anchor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Free the Keeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Go home."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Corruption shrieked—a physical sound tearing at reality."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Violet energy lashed viciously upwards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then—implosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence absolute."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Mars Spire flared blinding gold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s song—whole, triumphant, harmonious—exploded outward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fracture sealed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gleaming obsidian replaced weeping wounds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, the cosmic battle faltered as pure resonance washed over Martian dunes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet cooled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s voice rang crystalline: *\"Anchor secured."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pathway stabilized.\"* Silver light engulfed the Legion—not mist this time, but a promise."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula shimmered—approval?—as Mars dissolved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earth awaited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Next chapter 38"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "chapter 37: Luminaire Keeper"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Scorch lived up to its name at dawn."
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Heat shimmered off the dunes like liquid gold, warping the horizon into a wavering mirage."
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sweat evaporated before it could bead, stolen by the parched air."
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires shuffled forward, cloaks pulled high against the glare, boots sinking ankle-deep in scalding sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pack-lizards snorted plumes of steam, their scaled hides darkened by dust."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Even Zaron’s hum within Geralt’s armor felt muffled, dampened by the oppressive stillness."
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only Oreck moved with unbroken vigilance, his chroniton-flecked gaze scanning the blinding expanse."
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He felt it first – a low-frequency tremor transmitted through the sand, a vibration felt more than heard, prickling the skin beneath his scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not the wind."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something heavier."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Deeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Midway down the strung-out column, Private Ren stumbled."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He clutched his helmet, grimacing."
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Stars… my ears… ringing…\" Beside him, Corporal Vess frowned."
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It’s silent out here, Ren."
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Too silent—\" Her words cut off as the ground erupted *behind* them."
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fountains of superheated sand geysered skyward, revealing three monstrous silhouettes clawing free."
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dregans."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Towering slabs of distorted muscle and scarred hide, their useless wings pinned tight against bulging backs."
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their faces were grotesque masks of reptilian fury, eyes burning with agonized madness."
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One threw back its head, jaws distending impossibly wide."
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air itself seemed to *congeal*, then shatter."
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A focused beam of pure sonic torment ripped forward—not sound, but a physical wave of concussive disintegration."
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It struck the rearmost pack-lizard and its guard detail."
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Flesh didn’t tear; it *crystallized*."
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires and beast alike froze mid-stride, then dissolved into clouds of glittering, crimson-stained dust that rained silently onto the sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The horrific silence after the scream was deafening."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Panic choked the Legion’s rear ranks."
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shields flared weakly, useless against resonant annihilation."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Giantsbane deployed."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s head snapped around."
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The distant cloud of settling dust registered instantly—an attack vector slicing through his vulnerable rear."
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Mika!"
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hold the front!\" His roar cut through the rising chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dragonmail plates flared with sudden, searing azure light as Zaron’s spirit surged, responding to imminent threat."
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Time seemed to warp; Geralt blurred forward, not running, but *flowing* impossibly fast across the dunes, sand kicking up in crystalline arcs behind him."
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He passed Oreck, already reversing course with terrifying speed, the green arrows along his greaves blazing like emerald beacons pointing *back*."
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Together, they closed the distance in heartbeats, arriving as a second Dragan drew breath to scream."
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt didn't hesitate."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He *leaped*, armored form crashing onto the Dragan’s broad back like a meteor."
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His gauntleted fist, wreathed in crackling temporal energy, slammed down *not* onto bone, but onto the thick cartilage ridge at the base of its skull—a critical resonator node."
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The impact pulsed visibly, a ripple of distorted air."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Dragan’s scream choked into a wet, gurgling gasp."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its sonic blast misfired internally; blood and ruptured organs sprayed from its jaws."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Simultaneously, Oreck lunged low."
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His cleaver wasn’t aimed to kill, but to *disable*."
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The obsidian edge, humming with chroniton green, sliced precisely through the thick tendon anchoring a third Dragan’s colossal leg to its hip."
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The creature bellowed in agony, crashing sideways, its next scream lost in a roar of primal pain and frustration."
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The immediate threat stalled, but the peril was far from over."
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The screech of southern reinforcements echoed—allied Dregans summoned by the breach."
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Scorch drank deeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The southern Dregans erupted onto the scene with terrifying silence, their larger, sand-polished hides absorbing the harsh sunlight."
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No handlers."
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No hesitation."
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The lead Dragan’s territorial challenge cry wasn’t aimed at Geralt’s forces, but at their northern kin—a wave of discordant force slamming the raging attackers sideways."
    },
    {
      "line": 62,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The effect was immediate, visceral."
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The northern Dregans, consumed by genetic fury, whirled as one pack-beast, abandoning the legionnaires entirely."
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s assessment was a low growl felt in Geralt’s bones: \"Territory.\" The ensuing clash was apocalyptic—a whirlwind of snapping spines, sonic blasts detonating prematurely, sand fused instantly into glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires watched, shields trembling against debris, as giants tore each other apart."
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s bio-scanner whirred frantically, tracking the horrifying cascade of energy signatures."
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pragmatism, indeed."
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The victors weren’t saviors; they were conquerors clearing their hunting grounds."
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their departure left only the groans of the dying northern Dragan Oreck crippled and the settling crimson dust of its vaporized kin."
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence reclaimed the desert, heavier now."
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s fist lowered slowly."
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Regroup,\" he commanded, the word scraping raw."
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Secure the wounded.\" Bodies crystallized beyond the shield perimeter glittered accusingly under the merciless sun."
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren retched violently into the sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s gaze flicked to Lyra."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Stabilize Halvar *now*.\" The healer nodded, already moving, filaments pulsing urgent cyan towards the stunned veteran."
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Integration wasn't a choice anymore."
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Scorch demanded it."
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Adapt or die."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The deeper enemy waited, casting shadows far darker than Dragan packs."
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air thickened, losing its knife’s edge dryness."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Boots crunched on gravelly earth now, sand yielding to cracked hardpan radiating heat upward like coals."
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ahead, blinding white salt flats stretched—cracked crusts whispering false promises of water under the midday glare."
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s dragonmail hummed differently here; Zaron’s spirit recoiled faintly against the mineral scent carried on sudden, sluggish breezes."
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thorny bushes clawed upward from the baking soil, razor-edged grasses scratching against scaled greaves."
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence draped itself like a shroud."
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No wind whispers."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only the scuff of weary boots and the low thrum of shield generators."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then, a sharp cry echoed—Corporal Vess stumbled backward from a low mound."
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her boot sank calf-deep into liquefied clay where solid ground seemed moments before."
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The earth pulsed visibly around her leg, drawing her deeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Panic flared."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck surged forward, his chroniton-enhanced strength anchoring him on firmer ground as he seized Vess’s arm."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Don’t struggle!\" Mika barked, seeing the suction intensify."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The clay gulped hungrily."
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Guide her slowly!\" Geralt ordered, scanning the treacherous basin—this was no desert."
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was the land’s wounded throat."
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground betrayed them."
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Steps that felt solid crumbled into sucking mud without warning."
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sweat plastered hair to necks, no longer evaporating but soaking into grit-stained fatigues."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ahead, the Breathing Pyramid rose—a scarred monument of volcanic rock and sagging sandstone, its lower half dissolving into the shimmering haze of swamp breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stagnant ponds festered; alkali rims glowed poisonous white beneath twin moons."
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mosquitoes whined incessantly, a maddening chorus Lyra silenced near Halvar with targeted micro-pulses from her rig."
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Pulse… stronger here,\" Oreck rumbled, cleaver tip pointing downward."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beneath their feet, the faintest tremor resonated—sub-audible, felt through bone."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Void Spire’s dormant song."
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt halted the column before the pyramid’s shadowed entrance, a collapsed archway channeling dark water inward."
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His claw traced the air before the eroded stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A shimmering resonance field flickered—dry volcanic stone resisting humid decay."
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The threshold,\" he stated."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His armored palm pressed against the stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scales flared bright azure."
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stone groaned… shifted… revealing a slick descent into cloying darkness smelling of wet earth and ozone."
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Buried Luminaire awaited."
    },
    {
      "line": 122,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its trapped lightning would be their guide… or their grave."
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika tightened her grip on her shock-lance."
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Single file."
    },
    {
      "line": 125,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shields synced."
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Watch for voids.\" The descent began."
    },
    {
      "line": 127,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stairway breathed beneath them."
    },
    {
      "line": 129,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Water lapped at crumbling steps."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton arrows on Oreck’s greaves cast jade fractals over algae-slick walls."
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence choked the passage—not the desert’s stillness, but the swamp’s heavy, listening quiet."
    },
    {
      "line": 132,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only the rhythmic drip of condensation pierced it."
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt moved like shadow given form, Zaron’s spirit coiled taut within the armor, sensing dimensional fractures."
    },
    {
      "line": 134,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A legionnaire’s boot slipped on wet stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s hand snapped out, steadying him."
    },
    {
      "line": 136,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Three seconds,\" she hissed."
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Scan your footing.\" Lyra’s filaments pulsed cyan, mapping the unstable geometry."
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance spikes ahead,\" she whispered, voice tight."
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Micro-voids."
    },
    {
      "line": 140,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unstable.\" The corridor widened abruptly into a cavernous cistern."
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At its heart, rising from black water, stood the Void Spire—a needle of pure obsidian humming with trapped thunder."
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above it, refracted through murk, the Buried Luminaire’s crystalline core glowed… but its light was sickly, threaded with veins of deep violet corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 143,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Queen’s touch."
    },
    {
      "line": 144,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s fist clenched."
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Prime Keeper’s shard."
    },
    {
      "line": 146,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Under siege.\" Oreck’s growl vibrated the air."
    },
    {
      "line": 147,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Anchor point… compromised.\" The water rippled."
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shapes coalesced in the gloom—pale, multi-limbed, drawn by the dissonant light."
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Guardians twisted."
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or hungry things."
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s bio-scanner hissed."
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Multiple bio-signatures… converging!\" Shapes slithered from flooded alcoves—pale, segmented horrors with too many jointed limbs ending in needle-claws."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sludge-drakes."
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bioluminescent spores dotted their carapaces, pulsing sickly violet in sync with the corrupted Luminaire."
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They moved silently, chitin scraping wet stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik’s arrow flew first, a chroniton-tipped streak punching through a leading drake’s eye cluster."
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It detonated in a spray of ichor and temporal shrapnel, staggering two others."
    },
    {
      "line": 159,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck met the next wave head-on."
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His cleaver wasn’t a blade; it was a chroniton storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Green energy sheared through chitin, triggering cascading temporal decay in the wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 162,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Flesh aged centuries in seconds, crumbling to dust."
    },
    {
      "line": 163,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika coordinated the shield wall—legionnaires locking overlapping fields just as a drake spat a glob of acidic phlegm."
    },
    {
      "line": 164,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It sizzled against the barrier, filling the air with acrid fumes."
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt didn’t engage the drakes."
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He moved toward the Spire, Zaron’s spirit blazing within him."
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon-armor resonated, countering the violet corruption threading the Spire’s base."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Azure light fought violet rot."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Mika!\" Geralt roared over the fray."
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Cover Lyra!"
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She needs access!\" Integration became combat triage."
    },
    {
      "line": 172,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The healer scrambled forward, rig unfolding."
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her target wasn't the drakes, but the Luminaire itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 174,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stabilize the anchor… or lose them all to the Queen’s hunger."
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spire hummed louder."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The very air crackled."
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Water rippled against Geralt's boots as he reached the Spire’s obsidian base."
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s spectral talons manifested fully now, clawing at the violet corruption like physical rot."
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each touch sent shivers through the stone, dislodging calcified sediment."
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra slid beside him, her rig’s injectors unfolding like metallic spiders."
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Direct infusion required!\" she yelled, voice strained against the Spire’s rising thrum."
    },
    {
      "line": 182,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Counter-resonance!"
    },
    {
      "line": 183,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the pattern’s chaotic!\" Geralt’s helm tilted, focusing past the battle."
    },
    {
      "line": 184,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He heard it—the Luminaire’s fractured song beneath the Queen’s static."
    },
    {
      "line": 185,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Sing it *clear*,\" he commanded Lyra."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Not against the chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through it.\" Her filaments flared cyan, syncing with Geralt’s dragon-resonance… seeking harmony in dissonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spire pulsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 189,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light flared."
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The violet veins flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dimmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 193,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For an instant, the Luminaire’s core shone pure, trapped lightning refracted through murk—a dazzling prism of sound made visible."
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hope sparked."
    },
    {
      "line": 195,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the Sludge-drake Alpha emerged."
    },
    {
      "line": 196,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twice the size of the others, its carapace bore scars of Anunnaki implants forcibly welded to its spine."
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It reared, throat swelling."
    },
    {
      "line": 198,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not acid."
    },
    {
      "line": 199,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A beam of corrupted luminescence ripped toward Lyra—a mimicry of the Spire’s own power, twisted and vile."
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika lunged, shield-first."
    },
    {
      "line": 201,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The blast hammered her back, cracking her kinetic field like glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She skidded across wet stone, gasping."
    },
    {
      "line": 203,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck intercepted the Alpha’s follow-up strike."
    },
    {
      "line": 204,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His cleaver met its descending claw."
    },
    {
      "line": 205,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Metal screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 206,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton sparks showered the water."
    },
    {
      "line": 207,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar and Torren flanked the beast, blades useless against its thick plates."
    },
    {
      "line": 208,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik peppered its eyes, buying seconds."
    },
    {
      "line": 209,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s focus never wavered from the Spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 210,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s power intensified."
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Azure light coiled around the obsidian needle, peeling back the violet corruption strand by agonizing strand."
    },
    {
      "line": 212,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s hands trembled as her filaments fused deeper into the resonance field."
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Almost… synced!\" The Alpha screeched."
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its tail whipped, sending Torren crashing into a crumbling wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar leapt atop its back, dagger stabbing for implant seams."
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Useless."
    },
    {
      "line": 217,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The beast bucked, flinging him into dark water."
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika staggered upright, shock-lance spitting unstable energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 219,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Geralt!"
    },
    {
      "line": 220,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We need—\"."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire flared again."
    },
    {
      "line": 222,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Brighter."
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cleaner."
    },
    {
      "line": 224,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Alpha recoiled, its corrupted light beam sputtering."
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck seized the moment."
    },
    {
      "line": 226,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His cleaver plunged into the beast’s neck joint."
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not flesh."
    },
    {
      "line": 228,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The chroniton blade targeted the pulsing Anunnaki implant grafted to its spine."
    },
    {
      "line": 229,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Melted wiring exploded outward."
    },
    {
      "line": 230,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Alpha shrieked, collapsing."
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence fell."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only the drip of water and the Luminaire’s pure, strengthening hum remained."
    },
    {
      "line": 233,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra withdrew her filaments, swaying."
    },
    {
      "line": 234,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Anchor stabilized… for now.\" The violet veins were faded ghosts."
    },
    {
      "line": 235,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But beneath the obsidian spire, the water still churned."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something deeper than drakes stirred."
    },
    {
      "line": 237,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The descent wasn’t over."
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt turned toward the Stair’s shadowed continuation."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Move.\" Integration had bought them time."
    },
    {
      "line": 240,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Darkness ahead?"
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That was revelation’s price."
    },
    {
      "line": 243,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*The Cavern of Nammus - Atmospheric Entry*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Stair swallowed them whole."
    },
    {
      "line": 248,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each downward step crushed Geralt’s shoulders tighter."
    },
    {
      "line": 249,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Condensation wept from fused basalt walls, slick beneath scaled boots."
    },
    {
      "line": 250,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Air thickened—metal-tanged humidity pressing like drowned lungs."
    },
    {
      "line": 251,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No desert wind dared trespass here."
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only the Spire’s ghost-light bled upward, painting jagged silhouettes that danced with each flicker."
    },
    {
      "line": 253,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaire Corvin gasped behind Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 254,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A choked sound."
    },
    {
      "line": 255,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then retching."
    },
    {
      "line": 256,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pressure sickness."
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s buried song wasn’t heard—*felt*."
    },
    {
      "line": 258,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It vibrated ribcages, warping inner ears."
    },
    {
      "line": 259,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Equilibrium shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 260,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shieldbearer Jax stumbled sideways, helmet amplifying the dissonance into a skull-drilling whine."
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tinnitus screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vertigo pulled."
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below, the shaft breathed—a subsonic groan resonating through stone and bone alike."
    },
    {
      "line": 264,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s dragonmail flared azure, Zaron’s will anchoring him against the pull. *One step lower and your stomach drops—the resonance isn’t sound, it’s gravity bending.* He gripped Corvin’s pauldron, hauling him upright against the trembling wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sweat carved trails through grime on pale faces."
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 267,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only the drip."
    },
    {
      "line": 268,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the hum."
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 272,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Resonant Chamber - Cavern One*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 274,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shaft opened."
    },
    {
      "line": 275,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A cathedral-sized dome unfolded—stalactites hung like shattered chandeliers, wrapped in crystalline filaments humming with trapped resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 276,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Water pooled ankle-deep, hiding razor-edged mineral ridges."
    },
    {
      "line": 277,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt motioned: halt."
    },
    {
      "line": 278,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sound here wasn't trust."
    },
    {
      "line": 279,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Corporal Vess’s whisper echoed back seconds later—*\"Watch the—\"*—overlapping her own caution."
    },
    {
      "line": 280,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Auditory ghosts."
    },
    {
      "line": 281,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hallucinations whispered commands Mika never gave."
    },
    {
      "line": 282,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaire Ren spun, shock-lance raised toward empty darkness."
    },
    {
      "line": 283,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Who’s there?\" Oreck’s amber gaze scanned the vaulted ceiling."
    },
    {
      "line": 284,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Translucent shapes clung there—blind, choral fauna, spider-limbed and thin as paper."
    },
    {
      "line": 285,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Harmonic pulses rippled across their bodies."
    },
    {
      "line": 286,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A dropped power-cell clanged."
    },
    {
      "line": 287,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instantly, the creatures *stirred*."
    },
    {
      "line": 288,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legs unfolding in eerie silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 289,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They flowed down stalactites like liquid shadow, drawn to the sound’s epicenter."
    },
    {
      "line": 290,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s hand signal was sharp: *Absolute silence.* Survival demanded it."
    },
    {
      "line": 291,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Move slow."
    },
    {
      "line": 292,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Step careful."
    },
    {
      "line": 293,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust nothing your ears say."
    },
    {
      "line": 294,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fauna settled."
    },
    {
      "line": 295,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 296,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every scrape of boot, every rasp of breath, risked awakening the choir."
    },
    {
      "line": 298,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 300,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Erosion Galleries - Cavern Two*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 302,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Basalt yielded to fossilized roots—massive, petrified veins from the swamp above."
    },
    {
      "line": 303,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Water surged without warning, thigh-high torrents roaring through twisting tunnels."
    },
    {
      "line": 304,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires braced against carved walls slick with millennia of scum."
    },
    {
      "line": 305,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s rig flashed methane warnings: 82% saturation."
    },
    {
      "line": 306,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One spark."
    },
    {
      "line": 307,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One misfiring shield."
    },
    {
      "line": 308,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Annihilation."
    },
    {
      "line": 309,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt pressed forward, Zaron’s resonance mapping safe paths through labyrinthine gloom."
    },
    {
      "line": 310,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren argued with Halvar, voice tight."
    },
    {
      "line": 311,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We entered this gallery *minutes* ago!\" Halvar rasped back, \"Hours!"
    },
    {
      "line": 312,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Feel this ache?\" Temporal drift."
    },
    {
      "line": 313,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Humidity and void resonance stretched seconds into subjective eternities."
    },
    {
      "line": 314,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Compasses spun wildly."
    },
    {
      "line": 315,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maps dissolved into madness."
    },
    {
      "line": 316,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Navigation became faith."
    },
    {
      "line": 317,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust Geralt’s armored back cutting through the reeking dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 318,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust Oreck’s chroniton arrows flaring green at intersections."
    },
    {
      "line": 319,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust nothing else."
    },
    {
      "line": 320,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Especially not time."
    },
    {
      "line": 322,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 324,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Heart Chamber - Cavern Three*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 326,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light stabbed their eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 327,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The obsidian Void Spire plunged downward into the Lucid Storm—an underground lake burning with captured energy, teal and blinding."
    },
    {
      "line": 328,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Static crackled across Geralt’s vambrace, shorting displays."
    },
    {
      "line": 329,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaire shields flickered, failing."
    },
    {
      "line": 330,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra cursed as her medicae rig sparked, injectors dropping inert."
    },
    {
      "line": 331,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bioluminescent horrors—eel-things woven from lightning—snaked through the water, drawn to kinetic fields."
    },
    {
      "line": 332,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika glanced left."
    },
    {
      "line": 333,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren’s reflection shimmered on the lake surface—not his scarred face, but a sneering warlord draped in Anunnaki sigils."
    },
    {
      "line": 334,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar recoiled from his own reflection: a skeletal husk bleeding shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 335,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt saw Zaren’s dragon form fractured, scales edged in violet rot."
    },
    {
      "line": 336,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s light didn’t illuminate."
    },
    {
      "line": 337,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It judged."
    },
    {
      "line": 339,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck moved first."
    },
    {
      "line": 340,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Boots struck water—and the storm ignited."
    },
    {
      "line": 341,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Arcs of raw electricity spiderwebbed outward, seeking conduits."
    },
    {
      "line": 342,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gear sparked."
    },
    {
      "line": 343,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shields died."
    },
    {
      "line": 344,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren screamed as an eel-thing latched onto his greave, bioelectricity seizing his muscles."
    },
    {
      "line": 345,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar hacked it free, blade sizzling."
    },
    {
      "line": 346,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s reflection leered: *Weakness costs lives*."
    },
    {
      "line": 347,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She fired her shock-lance point-blank into the water."
    },
    {
      "line": 348,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mist rose, stinging ozone."
    },
    {
      "line": 349,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt waded deeper, Zaron’s spirit warring with the storm’s pull."
    },
    {
      "line": 350,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Azure scales flared brighter, repelling arcs."
    },
    {
      "line": 351,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the reflections... they whispered."
    },
    {
      "line": 352,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaren’s dragon-shadow coiled in the ripples: *Accept her power."
    },
    {
      "line": 353,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Let them burn.* Truth’s weight crushed his ribs."
    },
    {
      "line": 354,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each step sank him deeper into liquid light."
    },
    {
      "line": 356,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra stumbled, rig sputtering."
    },
    {
      "line": 357,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance overload!"
    },
    {
      "line": 358,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gear’s failing!\" Her own reflection showed her hands decayed, bones protruding—a healer’s failure made flesh."
    },
    {
      "line": 359,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire pulsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 360,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not a beacon."
    },
    {
      "line": 361,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A predator."
    },
    {
      "line": 362,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It sensed Geralt’s proximity."
    },
    {
      "line": 363,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The lake boiled."
    },
    {
      "line": 364,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Energy tendrils lashed, wrapping his legs."
    },
    {
      "line": 365,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron roared within him, a sound swallowed by static."
    },
    {
      "line": 366,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika fought beside him, shieldless, lance spearing eel-things."
    },
    {
      "line": 367,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren dragged Halvar from the water, both convulsing."
    },
    {
      "line": 368,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then came the voice—not sound, but thought etching bone:"
    },
    {
      "line": 370,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*ASCEND OR ANCHOR.*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 371,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Images flooded Geralt’s mind: Oreck disintegrating."
    },
    {
      "line": 372,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika dissolving into light."
    },
    {
      "line": 373,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires vaporized as raw power surged through him—dragon wings unfurling against the void."
    },
    {
      "line": 374,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s core glowed hungrily behind tangled roots."
    },
    {
      "line": 375,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sacrifice them."
    },
    {
      "line": 376,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Become its master."
    },
    {
      "line": 377,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence the storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 378,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet trembled."
    },
    {
      "line": 379,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beneath the water, the storm gathered strength."
    },
    {
      "line": 381,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 383,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cracked sandstone stairs vanished beneath ankle-deep water slick with condensation."
    },
    {
      "line": 384,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each step echoed too loud, too soon—a drumbeat swallowed by damp stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 385,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt led, boots sinking into unseen silt."
    },
    {
      "line": 386,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, the ceiling wept mineral tears that hissed against heated armor seals."
    },
    {
      "line": 387,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below, the Void Spire’s ghost-light bled upward, painting the shaft walls into jagged, shifting silhouettes."
    },
    {
      "line": 388,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaire Bren gasped behind him—a wet, choked sound."
    },
    {
      "line": 389,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then retching."
    },
    {
      "line": 390,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pressure sickness."
    },
    {
      "line": 391,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s buried song wasn’t heard. *Felt*."
    },
    {
      "line": 392,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It vibrated ribcages, warping inner ears."
    },
    {
      "line": 393,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Equilibrium shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 394,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shieldbearer Kael stumbled sideways, his helmet amplifying the dissonance into a skull-drilling whine."
    },
    {
      "line": 395,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tinnitus screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 396,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vertigo pulled."
    },
    {
      "line": 397,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shaft breathed—a subsonic groan resonating through stone and bone."
    },
    {
      "line": 398,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s dragonmail flared azure, Zaron’s will anchoring him. *One step lower and your stomach drops—the resonance isn’t sound, it’s gravity bending.* He hauled Bren upright against the trembling wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 399,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sweat carved trails through grime."
    },
    {
      "line": 400,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 401,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only the drip."
    },
    {
      "line": 402,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the hum."
    },
    {
      "line": 404,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stairs opened into a cavern dome—a hollowed cathedral of fused basalt."
    },
    {
      "line": 405,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stalactites hung like shattered chandeliers, draped in crystalline filaments humming with trapped resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 406,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Water pooled ankle-deep, hiding razor-edged mineral ridges."
    },
    {
      "line": 407,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt raised a fist: halt."
    },
    {
      "line": 408,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sound here betrayed."
    },
    {
      "line": 409,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Corporal Vess whispered, *\"Watch the—\"*—her own caution echoed back seconds later, overlapping."
    },
    {
      "line": 410,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Auditory ghosts."
    },
    {
      "line": 411,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hallucinations hissed commands Mika never gave."
    },
    {
      "line": 412,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaire Ren spun, shock-lance aimed at empty dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 413,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Who’s there?\" Oreck’s amber gaze scanned the vault."
    },
    {
      "line": 414,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Translucent shapes clung above—blind choral fauna, spider-limbed and paper-thin."
    },
    {
      "line": 415,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Harmonic pulses rippled across their bodies."
    },
    {
      "line": 416,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A power-cell slipped from Bren’s belt. *Clang.* The creatures *stirred*."
    },
    {
      "line": 417,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legs unfolding in liquid silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 418,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They flowed down stalactites toward the sound."
    },
    {
      "line": 419,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s hand sliced air: *Absolute silence.* Survival demanded it."
    },
    {
      "line": 420,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Move slow."
    },
    {
      "line": 421,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Step careful."
    },
    {
      "line": 422,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust nothing your ears say."
    },
    {
      "line": 423,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fauna settled."
    },
    {
      "line": 424,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 425,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every scrape of boot risked awakening the choir."
    },
    {
      "line": 427,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Basalt yielded to fossilized roots—massive, petrified veins from the swamp far above."
    },
    {
      "line": 428,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Water surged without warning, thigh-high torrents roaring through twisting galleries."
    },
    {
      "line": 429,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires braced against walls slick with millennia of scum."
    },
    {
      "line": 430,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s rig flashed methane warnings: 82% saturation."
    },
    {
      "line": 431,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One spark."
    },
    {
      "line": 432,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One misfiring shield."
    },
    {
      "line": 433,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Annihilation."
    },
    {
      "line": 434,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt pressed forward, Zaron’s resonance tracing safe paths through the reeking gloom."
    },
    {
      "line": 435,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren gripped Halvar’s arm, voice frayed."
    },
    {
      "line": 436,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We entered this passage *minutes* ago!\" Halvar rasped back, \"Hours!"
    },
    {
      "line": 437,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Feel this ache?\" Temporal drift."
    },
    {
      "line": 438,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Humidity and void resonance stretched seconds into subjective eternities."
    },
    {
      "line": 439,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Compasses spun wild."
    },
    {
      "line": 440,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maps dissolved."
    },
    {
      "line": 441,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Navigation became faith—trust Geralt’s armored back cutting through darkness, trust Oreck’s chroniton arrows flaring green at junctions."
    },
    {
      "line": 442,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust nothing else."
    },
    {
      "line": 443,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Especially not time."
    },
    {
      "line": 445,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light stabbed their eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 446,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The obsidian Spire plunged into the Lucid Storm—an underground lake burning teal with captured energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 447,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Static crackled across Geralt’s vambrace, shorting displays."
    },
    {
      "line": 448,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaire shields flickered, dying."
    },
    {
      "line": 449,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra cursed as her medicae rig sparked, injectors falling inert."
    },
    {
      "line": 450,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bioluminescent horrors—eel-things woven from lightning—snaked through the water, drawn to kinetic fields."
    },
    {
      "line": 451,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika glanced left."
    },
    {
      "line": 452,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren’s reflection shimmered on the lake: not his scarred face, but a sneering warlord draped in Anunnaki sigils."
    },
    {
      "line": 453,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar recoiled from his own—a skeletal husk bleeding shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 454,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt saw Zaren’s dragon form fractured, scales edged in violet rot."
    },
    {
      "line": 455,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s light didn’t illuminate."
    },
    {
      "line": 456,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It judged."
    },
    {
      "line": 458,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck moved first."
    },
    {
      "line": 459,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Boots struck water—and the storm ignited."
    },
    {
      "line": 460,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Arcs spiderwebbed, seeking conduits."
    },
    {
      "line": 461,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gear sparked."
    },
    {
      "line": 462,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shields died."
    },
    {
      "line": 463,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren screamed as an eel-thing latched onto his greave, bioelectricity seizing muscle."
    },
    {
      "line": 464,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar hacked it free, blade sizzling."
    },
    {
      "line": 465,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s reflection leered: *Weakness costs lives*."
    },
    {
      "line": 466,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She fired her lance into the water."
    },
    {
      "line": 467,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mist rose, stinging ozone."
    },
    {
      "line": 468,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt waded deeper, Zaron’s spirit warring with the storm’s pull."
    },
    {
      "line": 469,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Azure scales flared brighter, repelling arcs."
    },
    {
      "line": 470,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the reflections whispered."
    },
    {
      "line": 471,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaren’s dragon-shadow coiled in ripples: *Accept her power."
    },
    {
      "line": 472,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Let them burn.* Truth’s weight crushed him."
    },
    {
      "line": 473,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each step sank deeper into liquid light."
    },
    {
      "line": 474,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra stumbled, rig sputtering."
    },
    {
      "line": 475,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance overload!"
    },
    {
      "line": 476,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gear’"
    },
    {
      "line": 478,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 480,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire pulsed beneath the tangled roots—not a beacon, but a predator."
    },
    {
      "line": 481,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its core glowed hungrily behind knotted metal, half-submerged in opaque teal liquid."
    },
    {
      "line": 482,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Voices layered—Geralt heard Mika’s clipped orders, Oreck’s tactical silence, and his own thoughts looping back as distorted commands: *Leave them."
    },
    {
      "line": 483,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ascend.* The cavern groaned."
    },
    {
      "line": 484,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton crystals embedded in the ceiling wept glowing droplets that hissed where they struck the water."
    },
    {
      "line": 485,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaire Bren clutched his helmet as his own reflection screamed silently up at him—a hollow-eyed prisoner bound in chains he’d forged."
    },
    {
      "line": 486,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The roots… they’re shifting!\" Lyra yelled, voice frayed."
    },
    {
      "line": 487,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s casing trembled, metal vines uncoiling like awakened serpents."
    },
    {
      "line": 488,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One lashed out, wrapping Torren’s ankle, dragging him toward the luminous pool."
    },
    {
      "line": 489,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar lunged, shock-lance spitting futile sparks against the resonant shield."
    },
    {
      "line": 490,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet vibrated—Zaron’s roar reduced to static."
    },
    {
      "line": 492,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*ASCEND OR ANCHOR.*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 493,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The choice carved itself into his bones."
    },
    {
      "line": 494,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Images: Oreck disintegrating into light."
    },
    {
      "line": 495,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika dissolving."
    },
    {
      "line": 496,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five hundred souls vaporized as raw power surged through him—dragon wings unfurling against the void."
    },
    {
      "line": 497,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence the storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 498,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Claim the spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 499,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Become its master."
    },
    {
      "line": 500,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sacrifice the anchor."
    },
    {
      "line": 501,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s breath hitched."
    },
    {
      "line": 502,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beneath the water, the roots tightened."
    },
    {
      "line": 504,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s medicae rig spat a final spark."
    },
    {
      "line": 505,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her reflection showed bone where flesh should be—a healer’s failure made manifest."
    },
    {
      "line": 506,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She met Geralt’s eyes across the churning light."
    },
    {
      "line": 507,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It needs balance,\" she gasped."
    },
    {
      "line": 508,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Not a master."
    },
    {
      "line": 509,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An anchor.\" The Luminaire flared, its light searing."
    },
    {
      "line": 510,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika fought beside him, shieldless, lance spearing another root-tendril."
    },
    {
      "line": 511,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton droplets rained down like molten stars."
    },
    {
      "line": 512,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Time liquefied."
    },
    {
      "line": 513,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar hauled Torren free, both bleeding phosphorescent fluid."
    },
    {
      "line": 514,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cavern walls shimmered, dissolving into resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 516,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt plunged his clawed hand into the pool."
    },
    {
      "line": 517,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not toward the core."
    },
    {
      "line": 518,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Into the root-mass choking it."
    },
    {
      "line": 519,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s will surged—not domination, but *alignment*."
    },
    {
      "line": 520,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Azure light flared from his gauntlet, weaving through the metal vines."
    },
    {
      "line": 521,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The roots stiffened."
    },
    {
      "line": 522,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire’s pulse stuttered."
    },
    {
      "line": 523,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, the storm stilled."
    },
    {
      "line": 524,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reflections cleared—Mika’s fierce determination, Oreck’s unwavering vigilance, Lyra’s exhausted resolve."
    },
    {
      "line": 525,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Real."
    },
    {
      "line": 526,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Uncorrupted."
    },
    {
      "line": 527,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the roots *shrieked*, recoiling."
    },
    {
      "line": 528,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The pool churned black as the Luminaire’s light dimmed to ember-red."
    },
    {
      "line": 529,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something deeper than roots stirred in the depths."
    },
    {
      "line": 530,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Revelation’s price waited in the dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 532,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika seized the moment."
    },
    {
      "line": 533,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Shieldbearers—cyclonic pattern!"
    },
    {
      "line": 534,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cover the Commander!\" Legionnaires formed overlapping arcs, sparking lances pointed outward."
    },
    {
      "line": 535,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra scrambled backward, rig spitting diagnostics."
    },
    {
      "line": 536,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The resonance... shifting."
    },
    {
      "line": 537,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It’s rejecting the corruption!\" Her voice trembled with awe."
    },
    {
      "line": 538,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, chroniton crystals fractured."
    },
    {
      "line": 539,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Droplets fell like molten lead, searing water into toxic steam."
    },
    {
      "line": 540,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck hauled Torren onto a petrified root-island, the warrior’s leg weeping phosphorescent ichor."
    },
    {
      "line": 541,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar stood guard, blade singing as he severed another questing tendril."
    },
    {
      "line": 542,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cavern groaned—a sound of tectonic agony."
    },
    {
      "line": 543,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt remained waist-deep, Zaron’s light fighting the encroaching shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 544,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Integration."
    },
    {
      "line": 545,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not control."
    },
    {
      "line": 546,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire wasn’t a tool."
    },
    {
      "line": 547,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a wounded god."
    },
    {
      "line": 549,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s fingers flew over her Medicae Rig’s scorched panel."
    },
    {
      "line": 550,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Commander... the null state Sahvant theorized?"
    },
    {
      "line": 551,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara—she didn’t retreat."
    },
    {
      "line": 552,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She *split*."
    },
    {
      "line": 553,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A fragment anchored in stasis...\" Her eyes locked on Geralt’s dragonmail."
    },
    {
      "line": 554,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"...the other became the storm.\" The implications hung thick."
    },
    {
      "line": 555,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s light judged because it was broken."
    },
    {
      "line": 556,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her harmony sought not a master, but harmony itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 557,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s breath caught."
    },
    {
      "line": 558,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaren’s ghost-shadow whispered again: *Burn the roots."
    },
    {
      "line": 559,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ascend*."
    },
    {
      "line": 560,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Mika’s reflection—steadfast, unyielding—answered silently: *Anchor us*."
    },
    {
      "line": 561,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The roots coiled tighter."
    },
    {
      "line": 562,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below Geralt’s boots, the lakebed trembled."
    },
    {
      "line": 564,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wisdom came not from dragons, but desperation."
    },
    {
      "line": 565,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt tore a chroniton arrow from Oreck’s quiver—its green glow stark against Zaron’s blue."
    },
    {
      "line": 566,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He plunged it into the root-mass."
    },
    {
      "line": 567,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light exploded."
    },
    {
      "line": 568,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not azure or emerald, but pure, blinding white."
    },
    {
      "line": 569,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The roots shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 570,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Luminaire flared—not predatory, but *awakening*."
    },
    {
      "line": 571,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For an instant, Geralt saw her: Luminara, fractured yet radiant, a being of crystallized harmonics reaching through the void."
    },
    {
      "line": 572,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then agony."
    },
    {
      "line": 573,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spire’s full resonance hammered him."
    },
    {
      "line": 574,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dragon scales cracked."
    },
    {
      "line": 575,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Flesh burned."
    },
    {
      "line": 576,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron roared—a sound of triumph and dissolution."
    },
    {
      "line": 577,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The walls dissolved into starlight."
    },
    {
      "line": 578,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cavern vanished."
    },
    {
      "line": 579,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above the dunes, Earth’s Spire flared gold, announcing their presence to the cosmos."
    },
    {
      "line": 581,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 582,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stood on obsidian glass fused by his own power."
    },
    {
      "line": 583,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires stared, shields dark, lances lowered."
    },
    {
      "line": 584,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below, the lake flowed clear."
    },
    {
      "line": 585,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Healing."
    },
    {
      "line": 586,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s voice hummed through Geralt’s shattered armor: *\"Anchor established."
    },
    {
      "line": 587,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Transit protocols initiated.\"* Mika touched the liquid—not teal, but silver."
    },
    {
      "line": 588,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"She’s mapping coordinates.\" Lyra collapsed, her rig humming as it repaired itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 589,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Integration complete."
    },
    {
      "line": 590,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The null state… she didn’t hide."
    },
    {
      "line": 591,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She synchronized.\" Halvar flexed his hand—no trace of decay."
    },
    {
      "line": 592,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck scanned the horizon."
    },
    {
      "line": 593,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton sight showed branching paths: Mars, scarred and waiting; Dragon Nebula, shimmering beyond time."
    },
    {
      "line": 594,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The storm hadn’t ended."
    },
    {
      "line": 595,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It had shifted."
    },
    {
      "line": 597,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s light settled."
    },
    {
      "line": 598,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Warm."
    },
    {
      "line": 599,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Welcoming."
    },
    {
      "line": 600,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet pulsed with hers—a crystalline key embedded in his palm."
    },
    {
      "line": 601,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not control."
    },
    {
      "line": 602,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Symbiosis."
    },
    {
      "line": 603,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Mars Spire,\" he rasped."
    },
    {
      "line": 604,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"She’ll tear it open.\" Mika traced the fractal patterns forming on the sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 605,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"And announce us to every spire in the network.\" Legionnaires murmured—fear, awe."
    },
    {
      "line": 606,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra injected Halvar with stabilized chroniton fluid."
    },
    {
      "line": 607,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Transit requires precise resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 608,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One error…\" She trailed off."
    },
    {
      "line": 609,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The desert wind carried whispers: Anunnaki signatures converging."
    },
    {
      "line": 610,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Distant."
    },
    {
      "line": 611,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "line": 613,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck slammed his cleaver into the glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 614,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Green fire traced Mars’ coordinates."
    },
    {
      "line": 615,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"She holds the gateway."
    },
    {
      "line": 616,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We walk it.\" Geralt flexed his new hand."
    },
    {
      "line": 617,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s presence lingered—dimmer, fused."
    },
    {
      "line": 618,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dragon and keeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 619,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anchor and storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 620,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s final warning echoed: *\"They hunt keepers."
    },
    {
      "line": 621,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They hunt me.\"* The dunes shimmered."
    },
    {
      "line": 622,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not with heat."
    },
    {
      "line": 623,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "With transit signatures."
    },
    {
      "line": 624,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika loaded her lance."
    },
    {
      "line": 625,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then we hunt first.\" Five hundred souls readied weapons."
    },
    {
      "line": 626,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, Earth’s spire pulsed gold."
    },
    {
      "line": 627,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula watched."
    },
    {
      "line": 628,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Judgment had come."
    },
    {
      "line": 630,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s bio-scanner flared crimson."
    },
    {
      "line": 631,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anunnaki signatures surged—not distant."
    },
    {
      "line": 632,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Converging."
    },
    {
      "line": 633,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Seven minutes!\" she yelled."
    },
    {
      "line": 634,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sand hardened beneath Geralt’s boots."
    },
    {
      "line": 635,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silver light bled from cracks, forming a vast sigil—a dragon coiled around a spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 636,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anchor points."
    },
    {
      "line": 637,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Transit paths."
    },
    {
      "line": 638,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Formation Rho!\" Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 639,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires locked shields."
    },
    {
      "line": 640,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck planted chroniton arrows at each node."
    },
    {
      "line": 641,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar gripped his blade, knuckles white."
    },
    {
      "line": 642,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren limped forward, ichor-stained bandage taut."
    },
    {
      "line": 643,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"For Ironspire!\" The cry rose."
    },
    {
      "line": 644,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Brittle."
    },
    {
      "line": 645,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Defiant."
    },
    {
      "line": 646,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sand fused into obsidian beneath them."
    },
    {
      "line": 647,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Static hummed in teeth and bone."
    },
    {
      "line": 649,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sigil ignited."
    },
    {
      "line": 650,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires dissolved into silver mist."
    },
    {
      "line": 651,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt the void—cold, silent."
    },
    {
      "line": 652,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then pressure."
    },
    {
      "line": 653,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Crushing."
    },
    {
      "line": 654,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s ghost-shield flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 655,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s voice cut through: *\"Resonance destabilizing!"
    },
    {
      "line": 656,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton interference!\"* A shadow coalesced."
    },
    {
      "line": 657,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not Anunnaki."
    },
    {
      "line": 658,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wyrm-like."
    },
    {
      "line": 659,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Void-bleached scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 660,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Keeper-eater."
    },
    {
      "line": 661,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It struck."
    },
    {
      "line": 662,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt parried, dragonmail screeching."
    },
    {
      "line": 663,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton claws sheared azure scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 664,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pain blazed."
    },
    {
      "line": 665,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika materialized mid-lunge, lance spearing its eye."
    },
    {
      "line": 666,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It recoiled, shrieking silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 667,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrow pinned its tail."
    },
    {
      "line": 668,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s blade severed tendon."
    },
    {
      "line": 669,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Teamwork."
    },
    {
      "line": 670,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anchored."
    },
    {
      "line": 671,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The beast dissolved into ash."
    },
    {
      "line": 672,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Transit resumed."
    },
    {
      "line": 673,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mars loomed—scarred, crimson, waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 674,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Dragonwayne Nebula shimmered in the black."
    },
    {
      "line": 675,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Approval."
    },
    {
      "line": 676,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or warning."
    },
    {
      "line": 678,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Landing was impact."
    },
    {
      "line": 679,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bone-jarring."
    },
    {
      "line": 680,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sand replaced by rusted regolith."
    },
    {
      "line": 681,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Mars spire stabbed the horizon—cracked, weeping violet corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 682,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt rose."
    },
    {
      "line": 683,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five hundred stood."
    },
    {
      "line": 684,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Behind them, the silver gateway collapsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 685,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ahead, shambling forms emerged from dust-devils."
    },
    {
      "line": 686,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not soldiers."
    },
    {
      "line": 687,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twisted spire-constructs."
    },
    {
      "line": 688,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Half-metal, half-flesh."
    },
    {
      "line": 689,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s light pulsed in Geralt’s palm."
    },
    {
      "line": 690,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Warmth against Martian cold."
    },
    {
      "line": 691,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"She’s weak here,\" Lyra warned, scanner glitching."
    },
    {
      "line": 692,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Corruption resonance overwhelming.\" Oreck nocked an arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 693,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then we purify.\" Geralt drew his sword."
    },
    {
      "line": 694,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dragonfire ignited the blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 695,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"For Earth."
    },
    {
      "line": 696,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For anchors.\" The constructs charged."
    },
    {
      "line": 697,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence fell."
    },
    {
      "line": 698,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only the spire’s broken heartbeat throbbed."
    },
    {
      "line": 699,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "line": 701,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s consciousness flared painfully."
    },
    {
      "line": 702,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt her fragmentation—**Earth Prime Resonance Keeper**, stretched thin across dimensions."
    },
    {
      "line": 703,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her whispers were static: *\"Anchor points destabilizing... locus integrity failing...\"* Her nature revealed: not a weapon, but a symphony."
    },
    {
      "line": 704,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Harmonics clashed as Mika’s lance pierced a construct’s core."
    },
    {
      "line": 705,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instead of shattering, it *screamed*—a discordant note silencing her comms."
    },
    {
      "line": 706,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’re siphon points!\" Lyra yelled."
    },
    {
      "line": 707,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Disrupting her harmonics!\" Halvar roared, cleaving through rusted plating."
    },
    {
      "line": 708,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton decay slowed his blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 709,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torren covered him, shield sparking."
    },
    {
      "line": 710,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each strike fed the spire’s corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 711,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet pulsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 712,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s resonance surged—blue fire met violet decay."
    },
    {
      "line": 713,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Feedback seared his nerves."
    },
    {
      "line": 714,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wasn’t fighting constructs."
    },
    {
      "line": 715,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was fighting Luminara’s corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 716,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her agony was theirs."
    },
    {
      "line": 718,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, the Dragon Nebula shimmered."
    },
    {
      "line": 719,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Aelxion’s spectral gaze pierced the void."
    },
    {
      "line": 720,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The **Draconic Warden of Breach** saw the frayed connection—Geralt’s key struggling against Mars’ dissonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 721,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not a flaw."
    },
    {
      "line": 722,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A plea."
    },
    {
      "line": 723,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara needed equilibrium."
    },
    {
      "line": 724,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 725,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Oreck!"
    },
    {
      "line": 726,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton lattice!"
    },
    {
      "line": 727,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sector Gamma pattern!\" Arrows flew."
    },
    {
      "line": 728,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Green light wove a containment field."
    },
    {
      "line": 729,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The constructs faltered."
    },
    {
      "line": 730,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra injected her rig into the fused sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 731,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance override initiating!\" Luminara’s voice strengthened: *\"Syncing... anchor restored.\"* The spire pulsed gold."
    },
    {
      "line": 732,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pure."
    },
    {
      "line": 733,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Momentary."
    },
    {
      "line": 734,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Violet shadows recoiled."
    },
    {
      "line": 735,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A path opened—a fracture in the spire’s base."
    },
    {
      "line": 736,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika pointed."
    },
    {
      "line": 737,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"There!"
    },
    {
      "line": 738,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The core nexus!\" But Nyxthoria’s warning echoed from the nebula: Balance demanded sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "line": 739,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Void flames flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 740,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fracture bled darkness."
    },
    {
      "line": 741,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Keepers hunted."
    },
    {
      "line": 742,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anchors tested."
    },
    {
      "line": 744,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sky tore open."
    },
    {
      "line": 745,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reality rippled like heat haze over a forge."
    },
    {
      "line": 746,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Massive silhouettes glided across the Martian stars—not ships, but **living eclipses**."
    },
    {
      "line": 747,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wings blotted out Deimos."
    },
    {
      "line": 748,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scales caught the light of Phobos, glittering with crimson fire and nebular gold."
    },
    {
      "line": 749,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vaelros descended."
    },
    {
      "line": 750,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A roar unheard in vacuum shook the regolith beneath Geralt’s boots."
    },
    {
      "line": 751,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beside him, VALDRASIL units phased into existence."
    },
    {
      "line": 752,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Serpentine forms flickered between crystalline matter and emerald energy, executing impossible turns."
    },
    {
      "line": 753,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their jittering movements left afterimages—ghostly shimmers clawing at the mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 754,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One VALDRASIL streaked toward a bronze dragon, scales catching a dying sun’s fury."
    },
    {
      "line": 755,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Impossible."
    },
    {
      "line": 756,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Terrifying."
    },
    {
      "line": 757,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence screamed louder than battle cries."
    },
    {
      "line": 758,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 759,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s grip loosened on his blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 761,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Entropy beams lanced out."
    },
    {
      "line": 762,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not fire, but void made manifest."
    },
    {
      "line": 763,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twisting black-and-silver ribbons swallowed starlight."
    },
    {
      "line": 764,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where they struck a VALDRASIL, the serpent didn’t explode."
    },
    {
      "line": 765,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It unraveled."
    },
    {
      "line": 766,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Color drained."
    },
    {
      "line": 767,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Form dissolved into translucency."
    },
    {
      "line": 768,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gone."
    },
    {
      "line": 769,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As if it never existed."
    },
    {
      "line": 770,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s chroniton-sight flared—Zaron’s panic spiking at the violation of physics."
    },
    {
      "line": 771,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beside him, Lyra’s scanner shorted out, vomiting sparks."
    },
    {
      "line": 772,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance collapse!\" she shrieked soundlessly."
    },
    {
      "line": 773,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, dragons retaliated."
    },
    {
      "line": 774,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torrents of plasma—stellar fire twisted into solar prominences—erupted in electric blue and violent purple."
    },
    {
      "line": 775,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They washed over Anunnaki dreadnoughts."
    },
    {
      "line": 776,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Metal vaporized into lingering nebulae—glowing gravesites slowly fading."
    },
    {
      "line": 777,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Temporal weapons warped the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "line": 778,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Patches of space kaleidoscoped into probability cascades."
    },
    {
      "line": 779,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light bent around invisible singularities, lensing stars into impossible arcs."
    },
    {
      "line": 780,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bio-electric pulses flashed—green and violet lightning arcing between combatants."
    },
    {
      "line": 781,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The entire sky ignited in neon auroras: corrosive yellows pulsing with distant detonations."
    },
    {
      "line": 782,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires shielded their eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 783,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrow trembled."
    },
    {
      "line": 785,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below the cosmic ballet, Geralt’s army stood exposed."
    },
    {
      "line": 786,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Undisciplined."
    },
    {
      "line": 787,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unanchored."
    },
    {
      "line": 788,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Violet corruption pulsed from the spire’s base—Luminara’s fracture weeping darkness."
    },
    {
      "line": 789,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "VALDRASIL phantoms skimmed low, targeting the Legion’s chroniton signatures."
    },
    {
      "line": 790,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s lance flared uselessly against phased matter."
    },
    {
      "line": 791,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Shields!"
    },
    {
      "line": 792,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rho formation—now!\" Geralt roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 793,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Too late."
    },
    {
      "line": 794,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A VALDRASIL solidified overhead, crystalline jaws wide."
    },
    {
      "line": 795,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its bio-electric maw crackled—aimed at Halvar."
    },
    {
      "line": 796,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt lunged."
    },
    {
      "line": 797,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dragonfire met green lightning in a silent detonation."
    },
    {
      "line": 798,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires scattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 799,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shields buckled under stray entropy shrapnel."
    },
    {
      "line": 800,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two men crystallized mid-sprint—their terror frozen in obsidian glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 801,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’re harvesting us!\" Lyra gasped."
    },
    {
      "line": 802,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Feeding the spire’s decay!\" Geralt’s symbiosis with Luminara faltered."
    },
    {
      "line": 803,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her light dimmed against Mars’ dissonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 804,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anchor points dissolved."
    },
    {
      "line": 805,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula watched—T’Zurakai’s sapphire gaze tracking every branching doom."
    },
    {
      "line": 807,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then—the void answered."
    },
    {
      "line": 808,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Space rippled again."
    },
    {
      "line": 809,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not dragons."
    },
    {
      "line": 810,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not VALDRASIL."
    },
    {
      "line": 811,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A serpentine shadow—longer than Vaelros’ wingspan—coiled into existence. **Void-wyrm**."
    },
    {
      "line": 812,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Starlit scars marred its anti-light scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 813,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It heard resonance—the spire’s corruption, Geralt’s key, VALDRASIL’s discord."
    },
    {
      "line": 814,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instinctual."
    },
    {
      "line": 815,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "line": 816,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It descended toward the fracture."
    },
    {
      "line": 817,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Armies froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 818,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dragons banked away."
    },
    {
      "line": 819,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "VALDRASIL phased erratically."
    },
    {
      "line": 820,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dread washed cold through Geralt’s veins."
    },
    {
      "line": 821,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Survival demanded silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 822,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Luminara’s agony sang too loud."
    },
    {
      "line": 824,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Death loomed."
    },
    {
      "line": 825,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then—a spark."
    },
    {
      "line": 826,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not cosmic fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 827,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elemental."
    },
    {
      "line": 828,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earthborn."
    },
    {
      "line": 829,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From swirling dust—a pinprick ignored by gods and wyrms alike—four figures solidified."
    },
    {
      "line": 830,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instant."
    },
    {
      "line": 831,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Impossible."
    },
    {
      "line": 832,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Youthful faces etched with ageless authority."
    },
    {
      "line": 833,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Recognition flared hot in Geralt’s chest—impossible recognition."
    },
    {
      "line": 835,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "First: Clad in dragonmail like his own—but azure scales crackling with primal lightning."
    },
    {
      "line": 836,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Eyes blazing crimson."
    },
    {
      "line": 837,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He moved—a blur of cobalt and storm-fire—fist striking the void-wyrm’s descending snout."
    },
    {
      "line": 838,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A shockwave tore silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 839,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Molecular bonds screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 840,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lightning crawled across anti-scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 841,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wyrm recoiled."
    },
    {
      "line": 842,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not hurt."
    },
    {
      "line": 843,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stunned."
    },
    {
      "line": 845,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Second: Robes of solar fusion—amber, gold, blinding white."
    },
    {
      "line": 846,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No mage’s garb."
    },
    {
      "line": 847,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Battle-raiment forged of stars."
    },
    {
      "line": 848,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He raised an open palm."
    },
    {
      "line": 849,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A feather—incandescent—spun free."
    },
    {
      "line": 850,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not thrown."
    },
    {
      "line": 851,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chosen."
    },
    {
      "line": 852,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It curved impossibly, slicing through phased VALDRASIL constructs like they were smoke."
    },
    {
      "line": 853,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each touch ignited silent supernovas within their cores."
    },
    {
      "line": 854,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dissolution became celebration."
    },
    {
      "line": 855,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The void wept light."
    },
    {
      "line": 857,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Third: Royalty incarnate."
    },
    {
      "line": 858,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Armored in twilight silk and starlight plate."
    },
    {
      "line": 859,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Eyes closed."
    },
    {
      "line": 860,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Head tilted."
    },
    {
      "line": 861,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her fingers danced in empty air—reweaving spacetime like thread."
    },
    {
      "line": 862,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "VALDRASIL phantoms near Halvar simply... ceased existing."
    },
    {
      "line": 863,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unmade."
    },
    {
      "line": 864,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not destroyed."
    },
    {
      "line": 865,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Erased from possibility."
    },
    {
      "line": 866,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She stood utterly still."
    },
    {
      "line": 867,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Absolute war waged unseen."
    },
    {
      "line": 869,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fourth: Where shadow fought substance."
    },
    {
      "line": 870,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Barely visible—a flicker at the edge of sight."
    },
    {
      "line": 871,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yet shadows obeyed."
    },
    {
      "line": 872,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She stepped—not walked—between Legionnaires."
    },
    {
      "line": 873,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where his passing shade touched crystalline soldiers?"
    },
    {
      "line": 874,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They crumbled into harmless obsidian sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 875,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Precision perfected."
    },
    {
      "line": 876,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Death as artistry."
    },
    {
      "line": 878,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The assault lasted seconds."
    },
    {
      "line": 879,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Immediate threats vanished."
    },
    {
      "line": 880,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Annihilated."
    },
    {
      "line": 881,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The crimson warrior turned."
    },
    {
      "line": 882,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His eyes—Geralt’s own eyes—locked onto Geralt’s."
    },
    {
      "line": 883,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Recognition deeper than blood."
    },
    {
      "line": 884,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A silent nod."
    },
    {
      "line": 885,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Acknowledgement."
    },
    {
      "line": 886,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Warning."
    },
    {
      "line": 887,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then—a bronze dragon descended like fury incarnate."
    },
    {
      "line": 888,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They leapt onto its back—four impossible saviors—vanishing into the cosmic storm above."
    },
    {
      "line": 889,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gone."
    },
    {
      "line": 890,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Leaving only the echo of thunder and the scent of ozone deep within Geralt’s soul."
    },
    {
      "line": 891,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Questions burned hotter than dragonfire."
    },
    {
      "line": 892,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ancestors?"
    },
    {
      "line": 893,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Heirs?"
    },
    {
      "line": 894,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or something far stranger?"
    },
    {
      "line": 895,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula watched."
    },
    {
      "line": 896,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Judgment paused."
    },
    {
      "line": 897,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Curiosity sparked."
    },
    {
      "line": 899,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence crashed down."
    },
    {
      "line": 900,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A fleeting pause—a breath stolen from chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 901,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Now!\" Geralt roared, his voice slicing through stunned stillness."
    },
    {
      "line": 902,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Anchors—form!\" Time bled away."
    },
    {
      "line": 903,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Mars Spire pulsed, its violet corruption recoiling from Luminara’s renewed harmonic surge within Geralt’s gauntlet."
    },
    {
      "line": 904,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fracture lay exposed—a jagged tear weeping entropy."
    },
    {
      "line": 905,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Forget the war overhead."
    },
    {
      "line": 906,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Forget the strangers."
    },
    {
      "line": 907,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The window was slim: Luminaire’s brief purification."
    },
    {
      "line": 908,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar slammed his chroniton-infused blade into the fused glass ground."
    },
    {
      "line": 909,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Circuits aligned!\" Oreck’s arrows traced the dragon-spire sigil, green fire igniting dormant pathways."
    },
    {
      "line": 910,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s shieldbearers locked overlapping fields—a shimmering dome beneath the fractured sky."
    },
    {
      "line": 911,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires surged forward, not toward battle, but toward resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 912,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Precision replaced panic."
    },
    {
      "line": 913,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was not war."
    },
    {
      "line": 914,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was surgery."
    },
    {
      "line": 916,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The core nexus beckoned—a pulsing heart of corrupted crystal deep within the spire’s base."
    },
    {
      "line": 917,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s rig spat diagnostics onto the sand: \"Harmonic dissonance peaking—threshold in eighteen seconds!\" Geralt plunged his gauntlet into the fracture."
    },
    {
      "line": 918,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s agony seared his nerves—but beneath the violet decay, her true song fought."
    },
    {
      "line": 919,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pure."
    },
    {
      "line": 920,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Golden."
    },
    {
      "line": 921,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Desperate for release."
    },
    {
      "line": 922,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Pour it into her!\" Geralt commanded."
    },
    {
      "line": 923,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck channeled chroniton stability through the lattice."
    },
    {
      "line": 924,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s shieldbearers amplified Luminaire’s fading pulse."
    },
    {
      "line": 925,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar roared as his blade glowed white-hot, severing corrupted energy tendrils anchoring the decay."
    },
    {
      "line": 926,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion became a single instrument."
    },
    {
      "line": 927,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five hundred souls resonating with one purpose: cleanse the anchor."
    },
    {
      "line": 928,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Free the Keeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 929,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Go home."
    },
    {
      "line": 931,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Corruption shrieked—a physical sound tearing at reality."
    },
    {
      "line": 932,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Violet energy lashed viciously upwards."
    },
    {
      "line": 933,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then—implosion."
    },
    {
      "line": 934,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence absolute."
    },
    {
      "line": 935,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Mars Spire flared blinding gold."
    },
    {
      "line": 936,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s song—whole, triumphant, harmonious—exploded outward."
    },
    {
      "line": 937,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fracture sealed."
    },
    {
      "line": 938,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gleaming obsidian replaced weeping wounds."
    },
    {
      "line": 939,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, the cosmic battle faltered as pure resonance washed over Martian dunes."
    },
    {
      "line": 940,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet cooled."
    },
    {
      "line": 941,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s voice rang crystalline: *\"Anchor secured."
    },
    {
      "line": 942,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pathway stabilized.\"* Silver light engulfed the Legion—not mist this time, but a promise."
    },
    {
      "line": 943,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Dragon Nebula shimmered—approval?—as Mars dissolved."
    },
    {
